<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" style="margin:0;padding:0;">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>KickerGPT Product Updates</title>
    <style>
      @media (max-width: 640px) {
        .email-container {
          width: 100% !important;
          margin: 0 !important;
          border-radius: 0 !important;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body
    style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f5f7fb;font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;color:#0f172a;"
  >
    <table
      role="presentation"
      cellpadding="0"
      cellspacing="0"
      width="100%"
      style="background:#f5f7fb;padding:32px 0;"
    >
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <table
            role="presentation"
            class="email-container"
            cellpadding="0"
            cellspacing="0"
            width="640"
            style="width:640px;max-width:640px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;overflow:hidden;"
          >
            <tr>
              <td
                style="padding:28px 20px;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;"
              >
                <div
                  style="font-size:26px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#111827;"
                >
                  KickerGPT
                </div>
                <div
                  style="margin-top:6px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.28em;color:#6b7280;text-transform:uppercase;"
                >
                  Football intelligence
                </div>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td style="padding:28px 32px 18px;line-height:1.6;font-size:15px;">
                <p style="margin:0 0 12px;">Hey {{name}},</p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
                  We've been working hard to make KickerGPT better for you. Here's what's new:
                </p>

                <div style="margin:20px 0;">
                  <div style="margin:0 0 18px;padding:16px;background:#f9fafb;border-radius:8px;border-left:3px solid #10b981;">
                    <div style="font-weight:600;color:#111827;margin:0 0 6px;">🎨 Enhanced User Interface</div>
                    <div style="color:#4b5563;font-size:14px;">
                      We've redesigned key parts of the app to make your experience smoother and more intuitive.
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div style="margin:0 0 18px;padding:16px;background:#f9fafb;border-radius:8px;border-left:3px solid #3b82f6;">
                    <div style="font-weight:600;color:#111827;margin:0 0 6px;">📅 Extended Match Access</div>
                    <div style="color:#4b5563;font-size:14px;">
                      You can now access and analyze matches up to <strong>3 days ahead</strong>, giving you more time to plan your strategy.
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div style="margin:0 0 18px;padding:16px;background:#f9fafb;border-radius:8px;border-left:3px solid #8b5cf6;">
                    <div style="font-weight:600;color:#111827;margin:0 0 6px;">💳 Flexible Prompt Top-ups</div>
                    <div style="color:#4b5563;font-size:14px;">
                      Exhausted your monthly prompts? You can now top up anytime—even without a PRO subscription.
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div style="margin:0 0 18px;padding:16px;background:#f9fafb;border-radius:8px;border-left:3px solid #f59e0b;">
                    <div style="font-weight:600;color:#111827;margin:0 0 6px;">🚀 More Accurate Analysis Coming</div>
                    <div style="color:#4b5563;font-size:14px;">
                      We're adding more data context to deliver even deeper and more accurate match analysis. Stay tuned!
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div style="margin:24px 0;padding:20px;background:#eff6ff;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;">
                  <div style="font-weight:600;color:#1e40af;margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;">
                    ⭐ Exclusive PRO Features Coming Soon
                  </div>
                  <div style="color:#1e3a8a;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;">
                    <strong>Basic Plan:</strong> 10 free prompts per month<br/>
                    <strong>PRO Plan:</strong> 100 prompts per month + exclusive features
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div style="margin:24px 0;padding:18px;background:#f0fdf4;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;text-align:center;">
                  <div style="color:#166534;font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;">
                    Follow us on <strong>X (Twitter)</strong> for more updates
                  </div>
                  <a
                    href="https://twitter.com/kickergpt"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener"
                    style="display:inline-block;padding:10px 24px;background:#000000;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;"
                  >
                    @kickergpt
                  </a>
                </div>

                <p style="margin:20px 0 6px;color:#4b5563;font-size:14px;">
                  Thanks for being part of the KickerGPT community!
                </p>
                <p style="margin:0;font-weight:600;">The KickerGPT Team</p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td
                style="padding:16px 28px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;text-align:center;color:#6b7280;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;"
              >
                <p style="margin:0 0 8px;">
                  You're receiving this email because you requested access to KickerGPT.
                </p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 12px;">
                  Need help? Reply to this email and we'll get back ASAP.
                </p>
                <a
                  href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}"
                  style="color:#4b5563;text-decoration:underline;"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener"
                >
                  Unsubscribe
                </a>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>

